cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use QisDebug in your research, please cite it using the metadata
  below. The DOI always resolves to the latest release; cite the
  version-specific DOI shown on Zenodo if you need to pin an exact release.
type: software
title: "QisDebug: Zero-Touch Instrumentation and Timeline Debugging for Qiskit"
abstract: >-
  QisDebug attaches construction, transpilation and execution tracing to
  existing Qiskit code with a single start() call, records everything that
  happens to each circuit on one timeline (including mid-execution
  statevectors on Aer), and explores that timeline in a native GUI, a
  terminal viewer, or through an MCP server for coding agents.
authors:
